  "reviewQuestions": [
    "Is 2-2-3-1 a helpful and intelligible starting notation for two centre-backs, two wing-backs, three midfielders and a striker? Would 2-4-1-1 or 2-3-2-1 communicate the actual responsibilities more honestly?",
